<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $56-5/8 (FIM 256.94).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $56-5/8 (FIM 256.94).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR rose $0-1/8 to $56-5/8 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 256.94 markka. In Helsinki on Tuesday Nokia A closed down 2.50 markka at 253.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) was unchanged on Wall Street after closing up $0-1/4 at $32-1/4 on Monday. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 0.40 markka at 73.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed up $0-1/4 at $19 in New York on Tuesday. The price equals about 86.21 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed unchanged at 87.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
